this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe TextureStorage classes of both the RD and Compatibility renderers would swap the `DXT5_RA_AS_RG` and `ETC2_RA_AS_RG` formats twice during decompression (first in the decompressors - `etcpak` and `bcdec`, then again in the renderer). This broke the appearance of textures stored in these formats:\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| <img width=\"340\" height=\"340\" alt=\"old\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96861bee-92ba-4f9e-843e-c4e2a6365fad\" /> | <img width=\"343\" height=\"335\" alt=\"new\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c2e9c8b-ac0f-4764-ba3a-24902ce948f4\" /> |\r\n\r\nMRP: [etc2-ra-as-rg.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29103581/etc2-ra-as-rg.zip)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis is not an urgent issue, since Godot no longer compresses to these formats (and they will likely be removed in 5.x), but this is mostly done as an attempt to remove dead code from the codebase.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Re